  m_Name: FrilledLizard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  creatureName: Frilled Lizard
  description: 'The frilled-lizard drake is one of the smallest species of dragons
    in our world. This size does little to temper their aggression, as this species
    is also behind the most common type of dragon bite. [name pending]s possess a
    venom in their teeth and poison on their scales, so trying to eat one and being
    eaten by one are both painful endeavors for other creatures. Their venom is only
    lethal to creatures smaller than them, and they kill very few sapient life forms.

'
